  - line: 17
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_focus: Diagnose Pyroclast's thermal failure, identify the Anunnaki seeder organism, and recruit Kyh for the descent."
  - line: 18
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_boundary_evidence: Entry into the Spire resets the battlefield crisis into an interior diagnosis, planning, and recruitment situation; departure for the first crystal ends it."
  - line: 19
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_continuity: The Litho-Thanatic Bore Leviathan is an Anunnaki biomechanical terraforming/seeder weapon that consumes geothermal flow and blocks the primary thermal artery."
  - line: 20
    type: narration
    text: "It is not Node Gamma."
  - line: 21
    type: narration
    text: "Kyh assumes the practical navigator function after Vek'tar's loss, but is not explicitly framed as replacing Vek'tar or the unfulfilled Kaelen objective."
  - line: 22
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_presentation: Keeper meeting, planetary diagnosis, and Shadow Weaver recruitment"
  - line: 23
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_cutscene_purpose: Define the repair problem, establish the Worm, and assemble the active operation team."
  - line: 24
